# H-FA1 A/B for D-FREED-IMAGE-ADOPT-KEEPS-DEAD-LIFE-CORE-FIELDS-REGRESSES-FREE-
# DINODE on 2/disk/caw/direct g2b (test15 test16), disk locking: the second
# configuration of the campaign tests/queues/free_adopt_core_ab_tcp.queue
# started on 2/net/mesh/mpath, where rk1 and rk2 (this configuration, the
# build without H-FA1) logged two and one regressions of the shape.  Same
# build for both arms: ~/src/mxfs-g srcversion 534C42EF75B3E5A4996006D, the
# main tree's sources with every fix at its default (H-FA1 in, and H-IFD1,
# which this queue leaves at its default).  Run from ~/src/mxfs-g.  Every other
# setting is exactly tests/queues/rs1_skip_ab_caw.queue's (production
# settings: both test delays off, H-RS1 at its default); NG0_FREE_ADOPT_CORE
# alternates 0 (control) and 1 (fix).
#
# READING RULES: tests/queues/free_adopt_core_ab_tcp.queue's, written before
# the first lap of either queue; the two queues are graded as one campaign.
#
# Bound: the freed_nodelay laps' 1680 s per lap (they ran 472-597 s).
1680 MXFS_SNAPSHOT_DIR=/mxfs/snapshots NG0_IWR_WHOLE=1 NG0_IWR_REFUSE=1 NG0_CR63_DEFER=1 NG0_IALLOC_FENCE=1 NG0_FENCE_HINT_EXEMPT=1 NG0_PEER_UNLINK=300 NG0_DRAIN_BOUND=0 NG0_PUBCLAIM_GUARD=1 NG0_SELFCLOBBER_GUARD=1 NG0_MIRROR_CHECK=1 NG0_RECYCLE_GUARD=1 NG0_FRESHSRC_GUARD=1 NG0_DELAY_MS=0 NG0_IFREE_DRAIN=1 NG0_IFREE_REAP=1 NG0_FREE_ADOPT_CORE=0 tests/noino_gen0_ab.sh fac1 1 300 2/disk/caw/direct g2b
